The Risk Mechanism Theory Index (RMTI) is described in:

  Marolla, C. (2025). "Enhancing urban resilience to California wildfires:
  A systemic risk mechanism design and theory framework for a
  comprehensive risk assessment." International Journal of Management
  and Data Analytics, 5(1), 60-77.

  Marolla, C. (2026). "From Narrative to Algorithm: A Risk Mechanism
  Theory Index for Urban Infrastructure Investment in Sub-Saharan
  Africa." Natural Hazards (submitted, manuscript NHAZ-D-26-03050).

  Marolla, C. (2026). "The Risk Mechanism Theory Index as a triage and
  evidence-grading layer for hepatocellular carcinoma surveillance."
  (Manuscript in preparation / submitted.)

